CLAUDE.md

# Runtime coordination for the single Sony control channel (never committed)
.control-session.lock
.control-session.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Signing and notarization credentials. The build never reads these — it takes an
# identity *name* and a Keychain profile *name*, and the secrets stay in the
# Keychain — so a file matching one of these in the tree is an accident.
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
